    "# 04 — Spark MLlib Models\n",
    "**EAS 587 Phase 3 | Drug Overdose CDC Dataset**\n",
    "\n",
    "Re-implementing Phase 2 models with Spark MLlib \n",
    "\n",
    "| # | Model | Type | Features Used | Phase 2 Equivalent |\n",
    "|---|---|---|---|---|\n",
    "| 1 | K-Means Clustering | Unsupervised | CDC gold features | K-Means (sklearn) |\n",
    "| 2 | Random Forest Classifier | Supervised | CDC gold features + drug_category OHE | Classification (sklearn RF) |\n",
    "| 3 | Ridge regression | Supervised | CDC + KFF (multi-source) | Regression / Prophet |"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 0,
   "metadata": {
    "application/vnd.databricks.v1+cell": {
     "cellMetadata": {
      "byteLimit": 2048000,
      "rowLimit": 10000
     },
     "inputWidgets": {},
     "nuid": "d4448374-fe46-4688-ad59-9ebc23aa1145",
