    "---\n",
    "## Model 1 - K-Means Clustering\n",
    "Group states into overdose burden profiles using aggregated CDC death statistics.  \n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 0,
   "metadata": {
    "application/vnd.databricks.v1+cell": {
     "cellMetadata": {
      "byteLimit": 2048000,
      "rowLimit": 10000
     },
     "inputWidgets": {},
     "nuid": "084f156f-b0cf-4817-9be6-63292d0e3a21",
     "showTitle": false,
     "tableResultSettingsMap": {},
