    "---\n",
    "## Model 2 — Random Forest Classifier\n",
    "Predict whether a state-drug_category-year is high burden (top 50% by deaths).  \n",
    "**Phase 2 equivalent:** Binary classification model (sklearn RandomForest / similar)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 0,
   "metadata": {
    "application/vnd.databricks.v1+cell": {
     "cellMetadata": {
      "byteLimit": 2048000,
