      "Training Ridge Regression (manual sweep: 8 param combos)...\nDone.\nRMSE by params: [(0.01, 50, 1227.2835410640484), (0.01, 100, 1227.2835410640484), (0.1, 50, 1227.2873993672054), (0.1, 100, 1227.2873993672054), (0.5, 50, 1227.3631691194616), (0.5, 100, 1227.3631691194616), (1.0, 50, 1227.5375621447442), (1.0, 100, 1227.5375621447442)]\nBest params: {'regParam': 0.01, 'maxIter': 50}\nBest RMSE  : 1227.2835\n"
